    <tags>snag download-manager downloader video-downloader youtube-downloader torrent yt-dlp idm-alternative foss</tags>
    <summary>A fast, free download manager with a browser extension that catches any video.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[Snag is a free, open-source download manager for Windows.

- Big files download over up to 8 connections, with pause and resume (even after a restart).
- Video and music from 1,800+ sites (via yt-dlp): 4K, 1080p, MP3, playlists, subtitles, live recordings.
- A browser extension (Chrome, Edge, Brave, Firefox) adds a Download button with a quality menu and catches what a page's player is playing.
- Image galleries, torrents and magnet links, whole web pages as one file, GitHub repos as ZIP.
- Rules after download, an optional VirusTotal check, stats, light and dark themes.
- No account, no analytics: everything stays on your PC.

The package installs Snag for the current user. The browser extension is in the `browser-extension` folder of the install folder (load it unpacked) until it's in the stores.
]]></description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
